ote for immunity  immunity only lasts as long as he is in  office as Prime Minister or if he  remains a member of  knesset the move will delay the  prosecution of these three court cases  by months or even stall the process  completely until Netanyahu is out of  politics it's already been a very  uncertain year in Israeli politics and  the future it would seem is equally  uncertain Imran Khan al Jazeera West  Jerusalem
 

